IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-GUARD.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-TENANTS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOTAL-PAGES         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SANDBOXES-COUNT     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 OVERHEAD-NS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LORA-GUARD.
    IF NUM-TENANTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-TENANTS TO SANDBOXES-COUNT.
    MOVE 35 TO OVERHEAD-NS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SANDBOXES-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 OVERHEAD-NS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
